<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <!DOCTYPE html>
    <html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
        <title>DealPro | Dealtech Tool for Professional Dealmakers</title>
    
        <% include partials/boilerLinks.ejs %>

        <script src="https://cdn.tiny.cloud/1/tcu7wzuijq2kr1cmlp0pzf3o79z4k3qap72crqx8yzfbwc78/tinymce/5/tinymce.min.js"></script>

        <script>
            tinymce.init({
            selector: 'textarea',
            height: '100vh',
            theme: 'silver',
            plugins:  'autosave lists autolink save',
            mobile: {
                theme: 'mobile',
                plugins:  'autosave lists autolink save'
            }
        
            });
        </script>

    </head>
    <body>
    
        <% include partials/navbar.ejs %>

    <form id='editNewForm' action="/records/<%= loi.id %>?_method=PUT" method="POST">
        <button class="ui green button btnFinalize"><i class="fa fa-check"></i> &nbsp Finalize &amp; Save</button>
        <textarea id="mainMCE" name='opp[fullText]'>
            <img src="data:image/png;base64," width="58" height="51"></span></span>&nbsp;</p>
            <br>
            <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10px">480 Lorong 6 Toa Payoh, #10-01 HDB Hub East Wing, Singapore 310480 • Tel: (65) 6820 8000, Fax: (65) 6829 6600</p>
            <hr>
            <br>
            <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align:center; font-weight: bolder; text-decoration: underline">LETTER OF INTENT (RESIDENTIAL)</p>
            <br>
            <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px"><strong>Date: <%- moment().format('Do MMMM YYYY') %></strong></p>
            <br>
            <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px"><strong>To: <span class="spanLandlordName"><%= loi.landlordName %></span></strong></p> 
            <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px"><strong>ID Number: <span class="spanLandlordId"><%= loi.landlordId %></span></strong></p>
            <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px"><em>(the "<strong>Landlord</strong>")</em></p>
            <br>
            <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px">Dear Sir/Mdm,</p>
            <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px"><strong>RE: <span class="spanAddress" style="text-transform: uppercase"><%= loi.address %></span></strong></p>
            <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;">I am pleased to inform you that <strong><span class="spanTenantName" style="text-transform: uppercase"><%= loi.tenantName %></span> (ID NO. <span class="spanTenantId" style="text-transform: uppercase"><%= loi.tenantId %></span>)</strong> indicated the intention to lease the above premises based on the following terms and conditions and subject to contract:</p>
            <ol style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Rental: </strong>Singapore Dollars <strong><span class="spanRentAmount" style="text-transform: uppercase"><%- numConverter.toWords(loi.rentAmount) %> ONLY (<%- numFormat(loi.rentAmount) %>)</span></strong> per month exclusive of maintenance charges & GST (if any), payable monthly in advance. <span id='spanDiplo'><% if (loi.diplo == "yes") { %>The Diplomatic clause shall be applicable after <strong>TWELVE (12) MONTHS</strong> of occupation by the Tenant giving <strong>TWO (2) MONTHS</strong> notice or <strong>TWO (2) MONTHS</strong> rent in lieu of notice.<% } %></li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Period of Lease: </strong><strong><span class="spanLeasePeriod" style="text-transform: uppercase"><%- numConverter.toWords(loi.leasePeriod) %> (<%= loi.leasePeriod %>) months</span></strong> with an option to renew for another <strong>TWELVE (12) MONTHS</strong> at a mutually agreed rental by both parties concerned.</span></li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Commencement Date: </strong>The lease shall commence on the <strong><span class="spanStartDate"><%= moment(loi.startDate).format('Do MMMM YYYY') %></span></strong> <em>(the "<strong>Commencement Date</strong>").</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Handover Date: </strong>The handover of the property shall take place on the Commencement Date.</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Security Deposit: </strong>Equivalent to <strong>TWO (2) MONTHS rental</strong> to be paid on or before execution of the Tenancy Agreement.  Security Deposit will be refunded to the Tenant within <strong>FOURTEEN (14) DAYS</strong> after the lease expiry,  provided no repair and/or renovation works to be done thereafter in the event they were not made good by the Tenant.  Security Deposit is not allowed for off-setting of the monthly rental.</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Minor Repairs: </strong>All minor repairs below <strong>$150.00</strong> per item shall be borne by the Tenant.  Should the cost exceed <strong>$150.00</strong> per repair the balance cost shall be borne by the Landlord. However, for the first 30 days of the tenancy term, the Landlord shall be fully responsible for all repairs.</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Stamp Fees: </strong>The cost of stamping the tenancy agreement to be borne by the Tenant.</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Legal Costs: </strong>Each party to bear its own legal cost for preparation of the tenancy agreement, if any.</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Power Supply / Telephone & Cable TV Charges: </strong>The Tenant shall be responsible for all charges for services supplied by SP Services, Power Gas, Singtel and Starhub.</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Air Conditioning Servicing: </strong>The Landlord shall carry out the initial servicing to all air-conditioning units and to ensure all problems (if any) are rectified prior to the commencement of lease. Quarterly servicing of air-con to be borne by the Tenant.</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrical, Plumbing and Sanitary: </strong>The Landlord shall ensure all electrical, plumbing and sanitary fixtures and fittings are in good working condition.</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Due Diligence: </strong>Prior to the execution of the Tenancy Agreement, the Tenant shall produce all relevant documents to verify that the Tenants/Permitted Occupiers are not prohibited immigrants under the provisions of the Immigration Act.</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Tenancy Matters: </strong>Tenancy is subject to contract and formal Tenancy Agreement must be finalized and signed by the Landlord and the Tenant within <strong>SEVEN (7) DAYS</strong> from the date of acceptance of this letter by the Landlord.  In the event that the terms and conditions in the Tenancy Agreement cannot be agreed upon by both parties within the stipulated time, the Landlord shall forthwith return the good faith deposit to the Tenant without any deduction or interest thereafter neither party shall have any claim against the other.</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>"Good Faith" Deposit: </strong>The Tenant hereby makes a good faith deposit payment in the amount of Singapore Dollars <strong><span class='spanRentAmount'><span style="text-transform: uppercase"><%- numConverter.toWords(loi.rentAmount) %></span> ONLY (<%- numFormat(loi.rentAmount) %>)</span> to <span class="spanLandlordName"><%= loi.landlordName %></span> at <span id="spanBank"><%= loi.bank %></span> account <span id="spanAccount"><%= loi.account %></span></strong>. This good faith deposit shall form the first month advance rental upon execution of the Tenancy Agreement.</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Furniture, Fixtures & Fittings: </strong>The Landlord shall provide the following:
                    <ol style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 12px; list-style-type: lower-roman; padding-left: 20px;">
                        <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">To general clean and ensure fitted electrical appliances in good working condition.</li>
                        <li>To remove any furniture.</li>
                    </ol>
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Tenancy Work: </strong>The Landlord shall carry out the following works prior to handover:
                    <ol style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 12px; list-style-type: lower-roman; padding-left: 20px;">
                         <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Premises to be cleaned including all cabinets/wardrobes interior and all windows and to be in good move in condition.</li>
                         <li>Touch up paint to affected walls, if any.</li>
                    </ol>
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Lapse of Offer: </strong>This offer shall lapse within <strong>ONE (1) DAY</strong> from the date hereof. In the event this offer is not accepted by the stipulated date, any deposit or monies received by the Landlord shall be returned to the Tenant immediately and thereafter neither party shall have any claims against the other.</li>
            </ol>
            <br>
            <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px">Yours faithfully,</p>
            <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px"><strong>PROPNEX REALTY PTE LTD ("PROPNEX")</strong>")</p>
            <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px"><em>(as agreed and confirmed by the Tenant)</em></p>
            <br>
            <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px"><strong>On <%- moment().format('Do MMMM YYYY') %>:</strong></p>
            <table style="width: 100%; border: 1px solid black; font-size: 12px;">
                <colgroup>
                    <col width="50%">
                    <col width="50%">    
                </colgroup>
                <tbody>
                    
                    <tr style="border: 1px solid black">
                        <td style="border: 1px solid black"><strong>Signed for PROPNEX:</strong></td>
                        <td style="border: 1px solid black"><strong>Signed by the Tenant:</strong></td>
                    </tr>
                    
                    <tr style="border: 1px solid black">
                        <td style="border: 1px solid black; color: #d9d9d9">
                            <em>Agent Sign Here:</em>
                            <p class="sigTag"> [sig|req|signer0] </p>
                            <p>  </p>
                        </td>
                        <td style="border: 1px solid black; color: #d9d9d9">
                            <em>Tenant Sign Here:</em>
                            <p class="sigTag"> [sig|req|signer1] </p>
                            <p>  </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    
                    <tr style="border: 1px solid black">
                        <td style="border: 1px solid black;">
                            <p><strong>Name: </strong><%= agent.fullName %></p>
                            <p><strong>Reg No.: </strong><%= agent.license %></p>
                            <p> </p>
                        </td>
                        <td style="border: 1px solid black;">
                            <p><strong>Name: </strong><span class="spanTenantName"><%= loi.tenantName %></span></p>
                            <p><strong>ID No.: </strong><span class="spanTenantId"><%= loi.tenantId %></span></p>
                            <p> </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                </tbody>
            </table>
            <div style="page-break-before:always;">
                <br>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align:center; font-weight: bolder;">LANDLORD ACCEPTANCE COPY</p>
                <br>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;">I, <strong><span class="spanLandlordName"><%= loi.landlordName %></span></strong> (ID No.: <span class="spanLandlordId"><%= loi.landlordId %></span>) hereby accept the offer to lease the above-mentioned premises to the Tenant on the terms and conditions mentioned in the Letter of Intent.</p>
                <table style="width: 100%; border: 1px solid black; font-size: 12px;">
                        <colgroup>
                            <col width="50%">
                            <col width="50%">    
                        </colgroup>
                        <tbody>
                            
                            <tr style="border: 1px solid black">
                                <td style="border: 1px solid black"><strong>Signed by the Landlord:</strong></td>
                                <td style="border: 1px solid black"><strong>Particulars:</strong></td>
                            </tr>
                            
                            <tr style="border: 1px solid black">
                                <td style="border: 1px solid black; color: #d9d9d9">
                                    <em>Landlord Sign Here:</em>
                                    <p class="sigTag"> [sig|req|signer2] </p>
                                    <p>  </p>
                                </td>
                                <td style="border: 1px solid black;">
                                    <p><strong>Name: </strong><span class="spanLandlordName"><%= loi.landlordName %></span></p>
                                    <p><strong>ID No.: </strong><span class="spanLandlordId"><%= loi.landlordId %></span></p>
                                    <p> </p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>

                        </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </textarea>
        <button class="ui green button btnFinalize"><i class="fa fa-check"></i> &nbsp Finalize &amp; Save</button>
    </form>

    <% include partials/boilerScripts.ejs %>

<script>

    $(window).on('beforeunload', function(){
      return 'Please click the "Finalize & Save" button before leaving this page. Otherwise the file will not be usable.';
    });

    $( "#editNewForm" ).submit(function(event) {

        $(window).off('beforeunload');
    })

</script>

</body>
</html>